    "title": "Arkansas State's explosive 9th inning leads to 12-5 win over Little Rock - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Forrest Jones, Northeast Arkansas News ,\n14 hours ago Arkansas State (13-5) secured a dominant 12-5 comeback victory over Little Rock on Tuesday after an explosive nine-run surge in the ninth inning. The Red Wolves started strong with a lead-off home run from Ashton Quiller, but the Trojans quickly answered with three runs in the second to take an early lead. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
